WEBVTT

00:03:58.357 --> 00:04:02.042
Tamara, would you like to jump in?

00:04:03.765 --> 00:04:06.594
(Music)

00:04:06.594 --> 00:04:11.601
(Dinosaur roaring) (Laughter)

00:04:11.601 --> 00:04:13.778
MM: I should leap in.

00:04:13.778 --> 00:04:17.555
(Music) (Dinosaur roaring)

00:04:17.555 --> 00:04:22.704
(Applause)

00:04:22.704 --> 00:04:25.144
So then, after the fun, comes the more emotional side

00:04:25.144 --> 00:04:27.600
of what we do, because effectively, this technology

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.992
allows you to see the world through someone's eyes,

00:04:29.992 --> 00:04:32.905
and for that person to be able to take a moment in time